<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Sept 30.</p>
<p>CROP     SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>	   1996 91/95 Avg 1996 91/95 Avg</p>
<p>w.wheat   0    4	   98   96</p>
<p>s.wheat  37   22	   50   71</p>
<p>durum    24   16	   57   73</p>
<p>oats     46   23	   42   72</p>
<p>barley   32   17	   61   79</p>
<p>fall rye  0    1	  100   99</p>
<p>s. rye    6   16	   94   82</p>
<p>flax     36   18	    6   46</p>
<p>canola   40   27	   57   72</p>
<p>mustard  20   15	   71   78</p>
<p>sunflowers0    0	    0    9</p>
<p>lentils  11    9	   80   84</p>
<p>peas	8    9	   80   77</p>
<p>canary sd26   12	   14   64</p>
<p>total:   33   21	   53   73</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
